</member><member name="F:Cocolife.BLL.Common.Security.BChangePassword._Format">
	<summary>
 kgf 11182013
 ^ - start of string
 (?=pattern) - sub expression (positive look ahead)
 . - any single char except new line (at least one char)
 * - match preceding char/sub expression 0 or more times
 ^[a-zA-Z] - starts with letter
 \d - digit (0-9)
 [a-z] - lowercase range
 [A-Z] - upper case range
 {n,m} - at least n to m char 
 [\S] - any non-whitespace char
 $ - end of string
 </summary>
	<remarks>
 for reference http://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/ae5bf541(v=vs.90).aspx
 </remarks>
</member><member name="T:Cocolife.BLL.Common.Security.BChangePassword">
	<summary>
 User change password abstract class
 </summary>
	<remarks></remarks>
</member><member name="T:Cocolife.BLL.Common.Office.OpenXML.SpreadSheet.BCreateFromTemplate">
	<summary>
 Create/Stream new spreadsheet from template
 IMPORTANT NOTE/S:
 1. This class is for excel template with Header/Detail/Summary format only.
 2. This class will only work for a SINGLE ROW NAMED RANGE.
 3. Template should have named range for header and details.
 4. NamedRange Naming rules:
     a. Header range must contain "Header", if any
     b. Detail range must contain "Range".
     c. Summary range must contain "Summary", if any
     d. Column names should starts with "["  and end with "]".
     e. Don't leave a blank cell. All columns in NamedRange should have a value. Use "[BlankString]" for uniformity.
     f. All column names in NamedRange should have an equivalent column in DataTable. Datatable should have BlankString too, if any.
 </summary>
	<remarks>For enhancement/s:
 1. Able to use multiple row for NamedRange.
 </remarks>
</member><member name="M:Cocolife.BLL.Common.Database.BOracleFactory.getConnectionType(Cocolife.Utility.Common.Enums.SystemType.ApplicationType,Cocolife.Utility.Common.Enums.SystemType.UserInterfaceType)">
